  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b49f37c5fa00da746b87bbc578d5a175, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _noteTitle: Prof. Anish Mondal's Research Notes
  _noteBody: "October 14 — 20:30 HRS.\n\nThe administration brought in private security
    guards to lock down the Academic Block after 9 PM. Cowards and bureaucrats. They
    panic over fluctuating voltage and thermal spikes, completely blind to the breakthrough
    taking place right above them.\n\nThe resonance frequency is stabilizing. I left
    the Floor 02 Lab Key on my desk, but I cannot wait any longer. I am heading up
    to the Mechatronics Lab on Floor 2 to finalize the emitter prototype.\n\nIf the
    focusing lens, high-capacity battery, and pulse circuit board are assembled at
    the central workbench, the light gun will concentrate enough coherent beam energy
    to stabilize the field. I may be in the Mechatronics Lab all night."
  _paperRustleSfx: {fileID: 0}
